From 50384306c51a08ddffe04dbc53491ea9f990a3f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gokwok <531504879@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 06:39:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] virtio-devices: Reserve workers through activation context

Keep bounded one-shot workers in the profile prewarm VM-owned profile. Transfer the
ordinary seccomp and error wrapper at first activation without adding
a device trait setter. Preserve worker cleanup and fall back for changed
thread context, Landlock, reset and hotplug.

Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
Signed-off-by: gokwok <531504879@qq.com>
